# BIOINFORMATICS_WITH_AI
AI - driver bioinformatics portfolio - NCBI, BLAST, ChEMBL, RDKit; Molecular Docking for Drug discovery.
### 1. AI - Driven Drug Discovery Pipeline for Acetylcholinesterase (AChE)
This project demonstrates a complete AI-Driven drug discovery workflow targetting Human Acetylcholinesterase (AChE)
  - Fetched bioactivity data from ChEMBL 
  - Generated Morgan fingerprinting using RDKit
  - Performed molecular docing with AutoDock Vina
  - Visualized interactions with py3Dmol
